   "html": "<section class=\"page-hero page-hero--plain page-hero--compact\" aria-labelledby=\"page-title\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <ol class=\"breadcrumb\"><li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li><li><a href=\"rooms.html\">Rooms</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">Availability</li></ol>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Live availability</p>\n        <h1 id=\"page-title\">Availability calendar</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">See which rooms are free night by night, straight from our reservations diary. Choose a room and your arrival date, then your departure date, and book.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
